`s 38(1)(f) the limit of hours in any continuous period of 2 weeks` MEANS
    IF `by agreement under the contract of service the number of hours of work in every alternate week is less than 44`
    THEN JUST 88
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "where, by agreement under the contract of service ... the number of hours of work in every alternate week is less than 44"
    ELSE NOTHING

